{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;I am my own abyss and my own salvation.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;AbyssEschatonSurvivors&quot;</strong> is a bullet-hell roguelike game where you venture into shifting dreamscapes to challenge the minions of the Abyssal Lord, culminating in a climactic battle against the malevolent ruler at the depths of the Abyssal Maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/Battle01Gif.gif?t=1750137767\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u203b\u203b\u203b\u203b\u203b\u203b</strong>Within the Dream Sanctuary, you will encounter unexpected travelers trapped in cycles of fate. Hone diverse skills to empower your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/Skills.png?t=1750137767\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u203b\u203b\u203b\u203b\u203b\u203bcollect formidable equipment to repel increasingly powerful foes, and ultimately descend into the abyss of endless reincarnation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/extras/EquipList.gif?t=1750137767\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688150?t=1750137767","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/25b58c765104195d690438b4e8d686dea417a823/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750137767","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/1f7aea86d08c350fac62b923eee40c6c8bfa79ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750137767","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688150/1f7aea86d08c350fac62b923eee40c6c8bfa79ac